      <h1 class="article-title">The Book of Common Prayer</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">1928</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">The Daily Office from the 1928 American Book of Common Prayer, with Morning Prayer and Evening Prayer for daily devotion.</p>
